PARSFILE
#FullDataName Vehicle with Loads, Sensors, Trailer, etc.`D-Class, Sedan 2017: w/ 5 Sensors`D-Class
#VehCode Ind_Ind
#CheckBox0 0    
#CheckBox1 0    

symbol_push <<hitch_x>> 0
symbol_push <<hitch_y>> 0
symbol_push <<hitch_z>> 0
iunit 1
PARSFILE Vehicles\Assembly\Vehicle_30c22a64-baf6-443f-93a1-3f2a95df26b9.par
#BlueLink0 Vehicle: Assembly`D-Class, Sedan 2017` D-Class` , Lead Unit`Vehicle_30c22a64-baf6-443f-93a1-3f2a95df26b9

ADD_REFERENCE_FRAME LeadUnitPayloads
SET_EULER_ANGLES YAW_PITCH_ROLL
SET_X_NAME Xo
WRT_Xo
ANI_Xo
SET_Y_NAME Yo
WRT_Yo
ANI_Yo
SET_Z_NAME Zo
WRT_Zo
ANI_Zo
SET_YAW_NAME Yaw
WRT_Yaw
ANI_Yaw
SET_PITCH_NAME Pitch
WRT_Pitch
ANI_Pitch
SET_ROLL_NAME Roll_E
WRT_Roll_E
ANI_Roll_E
PARSFILE Output\Sensors\MoSen_934770e5-cb1c-4e98-a975-b347bcd2b2ae.par
#BlueLink5 Positions, Velocities, and Accelerations`Accelerometers at SM and USM CGs` SM and USM CGs` , Miscellaneous`MoSen_934770e5-cb1c-4e98-a975-b347bcd2b2ae

*IMAGE_TYPE PASS_THROUGH
*IMAGE_PASS_THROUGH Animator\Vehicles\AniVeh_4c0e86ee-c21f-408d-8b23-6643df4bf3f4.png

#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example shows a D-Class sedan with five acceleration and rate sensors. The acceleration and rate sensors simulate the accelerometers and rate sensors you would instrument a test vehicle with.
